[gd_scene format=3]

; The Pyre, east of the Ashfall, behind its heat (map offset (319, -144)): where the machines are given to the fire. A
; pyre burns on an altar under a tall flue, broken machines laid around it; a scripture plate tells the rite, and a shrine
; keeps watch. Only reached with Heat plating; the heat here is harmless to the plated. A trap (an Ambush): two of the broken
; machines rise as the pilgrim steps past the doorway, a gate falling behind it, until both are broken again.

